# The backend keeps a committed .env with the local/dev defaults (values that
# used to be hard-coded in src/config/*). Force-track it, overriding the root
# .gitignore's `.env` rule. Personal overrides still go in .env.local (ignored).
!.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
